{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_07_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b19ab8d3da300ebacee47b3a61898377c939a862df73c671d6366b594aa904b0",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_j:cmd-000008:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42820b35e844aafa393e8933de2f80ce4fce66732fac4f03a2b1e6f001301c97",
      "text": "……那么，今年的JIF出演偶像，\n就这么定下了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_j:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e2bb352c44dfc20e7e01c86dc64b587b4243d73c9ca2614aed3fa707f126089",
      "text": "等等！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_j:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b80be034bb0c063359f24e5bb245bf6d76fa415efc26c7c67083e6263b09bc9",
      "text": "雷、雷皇？\n会议已经结束了。事到如今您还要……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_j:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20a8e5fbd404ce257bcb0ce64489cca00c9bba4e43ac9a51d3776ec67c6b76e4",
      "text": "毫无新意的与会者阵容。\n一如往年被大事务所新人塞满的名单。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_j:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:913eff2fd90c5c783699e04d72b5ce25e50ac3e24b343a124c2c6d58e669caae",
      "text": "你们到底有没有认真考虑过\n偶像界的未来？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_j:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c94a2dd6efc23c462f5bb0f3dd3fc959d395049789431fbcf381bcd304a32970",
      "text": "我已经说过很多次了，应该设置投票产生的出演名额。\n为了倾听偶像粉丝们真实的心声！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_j:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:121027670d78f278407ac83d2f426528d79d04a2e7f949e4877b6a98b09922a4",
      "text": "又是这个啊……\n算了，既然您都说到这个份上了，那就依您吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_j:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25bf38f8a1adf9fde12f2dcc152429e6e7041e2e0476c9e9ece976fc76c81554",
      "text": "反正我觉得最后选出来的也还是老面孔就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_07:1_4_001_07_j:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41899aace6e8b722e7f44d76d24958c687110343f1de0fdc62133b1ce84342a0",
      "text": "不。……一定会有脱颖而出的事务所的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
